  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnership Development Meeting in Amman</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The necessity and objective of this partnership development trip is twofold: 1) Understanding the ongoing war and conflict between Hamas and Israel and its deep impact on the participants of the current partnership project, on Musalaha as an organization and the future of the vision of reconciliation in between the implicated people groups. 2) On the analyse of the above and the current partnership project this trip will lay the foundation of the next partnership project, that we hope to apply for in the second half of 2024. The meetings will be held in Amman, Jordan, because of travel restrictions to Israel for the Palestinians and to Bethlehem for the Danes.</narrative>
  </description>
